      The mail daemon can deliver in-game messages aside from the
scrolls that give notification of incoming mail.  You'll need to
write some code to utilize it though.  [You'd get this for free
with the VMS port.  NetHack intercepts messages sent to players'
terminals and then uses the mail daemon to deliver them in a less
disruptive fashion than just blasting text on to the screen.]

      Having the mail daemon run through a mob of monsters has the
potential to impact play though, since he can bump creatures out
of his way while trying to reach the character.


